All good, we're ready to build :)


##### Build your firmware and flash it to your device

Now navigate to the directory containing your project. (If you don't have one,
try our
[HelloWorld](https://gitlab.com/hamishcunningham/the-internet-of-things/-/tree/master/exercises/HelloWorld)
example to get started. GitLab will download just that directory for you if
you click on "code" and select "zip" at the bottom.)

```
PS C:\> cd .\the-internet-of-things-master-exercises-HelloWorld\exercises\HelloWorld\
PS C:\the-internet-of-things-master-exercises-HelloWorld\exercises\HelloWorld> ls
    Directory: C:\the-internet-of-things-master-exercises-HelloWorld\exercises\HelloWorld
Mode                 LastWriteTime         Length Name
----                 -------------         ------ ----
